'''Clyde Gory''' (クライドゴリさん, ''Kuraido Gori-san'', '''Clyde Gori-san''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[PAC-MAN Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Clyde Gory
|image = E 780.png
|first appearance = [[PAC-MAN Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 700¢ - 2,765¢
}}

==Enemy==
A [[Gory]] variant with significantly increased health and roughly doubled damage. It drops slightly more money as well.

==Strategy==
At 100%, this enemy is essentially just a weaker version of the 400% Gories encountered in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3. Like other Gory variants, killing Clyde Gory with a [[:Category:Cats with Money Up ability|Money Up Cat]] can provide a significant cash boost and is usually worth going for if possible.

